NOTICE

GODSEYE is an independent project. It replicates the features of OSIRIS
(https://github.com/simplifaisoul/osiris), OSIRIS © 2026 simplifaisoul, released
under the MIT License, and reuses some of its data tables and behaviours with
attribution. Files substantially derived from OSIRIS are listed below and carry
a header comment naming the OSIRIS source file:

  Data tables
  public/data/chokepoints.json              OSIRIS CHOKEPOINTS table
  public/data/nuclear-curated.json          OSIRIS NUCLEAR_FACILITIES table
  public/data/zones.json                    OSIRIS conflict-zone list (names only;
                                            geometry is Natural Earth)
  public/data/ports.json                    OSIRIS curated major ports (52 rows)
  src/lib/presets.ts                        OSIRIS region presets (12)
  src/lib/layer-registry.ts                 OSIRIS LAYER_GROUPS
  src/lib/tool-registry.ts                  OSIRIS tool labels and tooltips
  src/lib/schemas/space.ts                  OSIRIS MISSION_CLASSIFY palette
  src/styles/tokens.css                     OSIRIS "HORUS" theme tokens
  src/components/hud/style-engine.ts        OSIRIS style-studio presets (6)
  src/components/panels/recon/server/scanner.ts
                                            OSIRIS scanner type list (9)

  Behaviour ported from OSIRIS modules
  src/features/aviation/classify.ts         src/app/api/flights/route.ts
                                            (classifyFlight)
  src/components/panels/intel/server/digest.ts
                                            alert-digest.ts (clustering)
  src/components/panels/intel/server/classify.ts
                                            alert-digest.ts (term matching)
  src/lib/map/terrain.ts                    map-terrain.ts (state machine)
  src/lib/map/terrain-layer-order.ts        map-terrain.ts (layer ordering)
  src/lib/map/night-lights.ts               terrain-tiles.ts (fetch queue ideas)
  src/lib/map/view.ts                       map-projection.ts, OsirisMap.tsx
                                            (projection ease, context attempts)

Other bundled data with a notice requirement:
  public/data/airports*.json                time zones from mwgg/Airports
                                            (© mwgg, MIT License)

GODSEYE does not use the OSIRIS name, logo, links or promotions. World Monitor
and Orodruin (AGPL) were studied for ideas only; no code was copied from them.
Third-party data sources and their licences are listed in docs/DATA_SOURCES.md
and in the in-app attribution panel.
